== Overview ==
The '''Dual Cargo Toilets''' are an [[Enemies|Enemy]] that appear on Wave 80 of [[Endless Mode]]. This is the first enemy with the ability to spawn other toilet enemies. Added in the [[Episode 71 Update]].

== Appearance ==

The '''Dual Cargo Toilets''' look like 2 toilets attached to each other, similar to the toilets welded by the [[Welder Toilet]]. They have a large container attached below their toilet bowl.
== Abilities ==
On death, spawns 2 glitch toilets from the cargo container. This is a deadly ability, as one glitch toilet tends to be a bit of a struggle, but two might be hard for many players. It is recommended to have good AoE units for this.
== Trivia ==

* This is based of off the [https://skibidi-toilet.fandom.com/wiki/Double_Transporter_Skibidi_Toilet?so=search Double Transporter Skibidi Toilet] in the series.
* This is currently the first toilet to be a Spawner, for it can spawn 2 [[Glitch Toilet|Glitch Toilets]] upon its death.
* There is a glitch that the glitch toilets don’t get affected by the health of the dual cargo toilets.

